{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And YHWH appeared in the tent.</b> The known explanation is that the pillar of cloud was over the entrance, and HaShem was seen inside the tent — this is the glory. And speech and command — this is <span class=\"he\">ויצו את יהושע בן נון</span> (and He commanded Joshua son of Nun) — by command of HaShem, blessed be He. Therefore He said, <span class=\"he\">אשר נשבעתי להם</span> (which I swore to them). And afterwards the section <span class=\"he\">הנך שוכב עם אבותיך</span> (Behold, you are about to lie with your fathers) is attached. And there is no earlier and later in the Torah. Likewise the section <span class=\"he\">ויהי ככלות משה לכתוב</span> (And it came to pass when Moses finished writing) is attached to <span class=\"he\">ויכתוב משה את התורה הזאת</span> (And Moses wrote this Torah)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:25:40.290704720Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}